msgid "Audio file extentions to try to match when using --audio-file-auto, --autocreate-playlist or --directory-filter-types. By mpv.net used to create file associations and used by the auto-load-folder feature. Default: mp3,wav,flac,m4a,aac,ogg,opus,wma,alac,aiff,aif,ape,wv,mka,ac3,dts,eac3,amr,au,mp2,mpa,mpc,thd,w64,oga,ogm,dtshd,dtshr,dtsma"
